use of the information, and HSE provides the information without warranty.
Read the full licence text at the address above.

Source files in sources/ are unmodified copies of HSE publications downloaded
on 3 October 2026; see sources/MANIFEST.csv for each URL.

COMPLYONSITE CONTRIBUTION

The selection, restructuring into long format, field names, documentation,
